# Klynt

Klynt is a tiny, dependency-free task queue built for developers who prefer
clean APIs over heavy frameworks.

## Features

- Zero dependencies
- Promise-based execution
- Sequential task processing
- Tiny footprint
- Easy to extend

## Example

import Klynt from "./src/index.js";

const queue = new Klynt();

queue.add(async () => console.log("First"));
queue.add(async () => console.log("Second"));

await queue.run();

Output

First
Second

## Why Klynt?

Most queue libraries solve every possible problem.
Klynt focuses on doing one thing well: running asynchronous tasks in order.

